int \fBgf_sftp_client_close\fP (gf_sftp_client *c, const uint8_t *handle, size_t hl, void *tag, uint32_t *id);
Requests.  Each takes a TAG, handed back in the response, and stores the id used in *ID (which may be NULL).  GF_ERR_AGAIN: too many outstanding or too much unsent; wait for a response or gf_sftp_client_writable.
.TP
